## System design first

Before implementing a feature, task or refactor, read
`<path-to>/system-design-first/SKILL.md` and follow it: gauge the depth
(L0-L3), scope the functional and non-functional requirements, estimate load
and data volume, describe the current design from the real code, propose the
target design with pattern trade-offs, and write the design brief before
coding. Reference material lives next to it in `references/`. Trivial changes
(L0) need no brief.
